  (text "POWER FUNCTION / CROSS-REFERENCES\nQ0 isolates live conductors. QF1-4 isolate/protect individual motors; KM1-4 disconnect motor power on a safety trip.\nT1 uses conventional winding symbols. PS1 rectifies/regulates isolated 24VAC to 24VDC; PS2 supplies isolated Arduino/Wi-Fi power.\nPE bonds panel and motor frames; do not switch/fuse PE. Select suppression, overload coordination, cables, fault rating and stopping category.\nCONCEPT - NOT FOR CONSTRUCTION: confirm ratings, manufacturer terminals, guard coverage and flour-dust / explosion risk." (at 25.4 385 0) (effects (font (size 1.8 1.8)) (justify left)) (uuid "2df8e235-eb8e-42c7-a0f5-98061ae40045"))
