  (text "T1 -> BR1 -> C1 -> PS1 (24V regulated) -> PS2 (isolated 9V).\n24VAC is about 34V peak before load/ripple. HV regulator input\nand capacitor/bridge ratings must cover transformer tolerance.\nC1 value, VA and current budget require calculation before build." (at 127 63.5 0) (effects (font (size 2 2)) (justify left)) (uuid "ffcd2a3d-f043-45eb-b690-0bd97454696b"))
